@startuml
title UC-16 - Unified workload environment variables (DEVEX-ENV)
autonumber
actor Developer as Dev
boundary "Workload editor" as UI
control "Reference catalog" as Catalog
control "UC-12 Configuration" as Keys
control "UC-01 Environment" as Env
control "Workload configuration" as Config
database "Desired configuration store" as Store

Dev -> UI: Open Application/Environment workload [MS-01..03]
UI -> Catalog: Scoped keys, Type inputs/outputs/classes, Services
Catalog --> UI: Metadata (no Secret values)
Dev -> UI: Add row: name + direct value [MS-04]
opt Choose a reference [BR-26]
  Dev -> UI: Open Choose from; search shared keys/outputs/Services
  UI --> Dev: Scoped source names; no local variable candidates
  Dev -> UI: Select reference for this row
end
opt Create Application variable or Secret inline [MS-05, BR-21]
  opt Secret and no selected store [BR-24]
    Dev -> UI: Select READY store and explicitly Save store
    UI -> Env: Versioned initial store selection
    Env --> UI: Saved store / safe error
  end
  Dev -> UI: Create and select key
  UI -> Keys: CreateKey(name, kind, value, config version)
  Keys -> Keys: Validate scope, absence, version and store\nSecret write uses existing immutable provider boundary
  Keys -> Store: CAS new desired configuration revision
  Store --> Keys: Committed revision
  Keys --> UI: Safe metadata + version
  UI -> UI: Select key in initiating row; clear Secret input
  note right of UI
    Key committed; workload still unsaved.
    Cancel workload does not delete key.
  end note
end
opt Add resource inline [BR-22]
  Dev -> UI: Choose new shared resource or existing app/env resource [BR-28..30]
  UI -> UI: Generate stable ID for new resource; preserve selected ID/class/params
  Dev -> UI: Local alias and typed inputs; optional advanced private scope
  UI -> UI: Validate and add dependency to local draft only
  Dev -> UI: Select output explicitly
end
Dev -> UI: Save workload [MS-06..07]
UI -> UI: Validate names/sources; encode ordinary literal strings
UI -> Config: Save Score with draft version
Config -> Catalog: Validate Type params and references
Config -> Store: CAS desired draft + trusted ordinary-value provenance
Store --> UI: Pending status
UI --> Dev: Explicit Preview then Deploy available
note over Config,Store
  No runtime mutation. Current-set Edit exposes ordinary literals
  only with exact trusted provenance; legacy unknowns stay unavailable.
end note
alt Delete workload [VAR-02]
  Dev -> UI: Confirm deletion
  UI -> Config: Mark pending deletion
  Config -> Store: Save pending deletion
  Store --> UI: Pending status + Undo
end
note over Dev
ENV-UX: enter name/value directly; open one reference picker only when needed.
Application keys are scoped to the selected app/environment; local rows are not sources.
end note
@enduml
